INSERT INTO `ha_term_relationships` (`object_id`,`term_taxonomy_id`,`term_order`) SELECT @translation_id,tt.term_taxonomy_id,0 FROM `ha_term_taxonomy` tt JOIN `ha_terms` t ON t.term_id=tt.term_id WHERE @translation_id IS NOT NULL AND tt.taxonomy='category' AND t.slug='iraq' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `ha_term_relationships` r WHERE r.object_id=@translation_id AND r.term_taxonomy_id=tt.term_taxonomy_id) LIMIT 1;
INSERT INTO `ha_posts` (`post_author`,`post_date`,`post_date_gmt`,`post_content`,`post_title`,`post_excerpt`,`post_status`,`comment_status`,`ping_status`,`post_name`,`post_modified`,`post_modified_gmt`,`post_parent`,`guid`,`menu_order`,`post_type`,`post_mime_type`,`comment_count`) SELECT 1,NOW(),UTC_TIMESTAMP(),'<p>Optimal and uniform water delivery is one of the most critical factors for success in vegetable gardens and specialized crops. In drip irrigation systems, <strong>20 cm tape, 1000 m roll</strong> Thanks to its high flexibility and suitable coverage of the space between the main pipes, it is a highly preferred choice. This comprehensive guide will teach you all the details of selecting, pricing, and technical aspects of this product so that you can make a smart investment.</p>\n<h2>Anatomy of 20 cm tape and the importance of the 1000 m roll</h2>\n<p>To better understand the value of the purchase, you must know the delicate structure of this component. A width of 20 cm is an ideal (optimal) spacing for many plant covers and seed vegetables. This width ensures that water is released exactly in the root zone, resulting in optimal consumption with minimal moisture loss. 1000-meter rolls also have different economic and logistical concepts from shorter rolls; they reduce the total cost per meter and minimize the number of connections along the irrigation lines.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PVC or PE material:</strong> Material selection directly affects the useful life and resistance to water salinity.</li>\n<li><strong>UV protection:</strong> Sunlight is the enemy of plastic; a protective UV layer is essential.</li>\n<li><strong>Emitter Accuracy: Verify the uniformity of drip emitter output.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you are looking for complementary solutions, reading the article on the benefits of tape drip irrigation can provide you with a better understanding of the advantages of this technique.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Technical Guidelines for Selecting the Appropriate Drip Tape</h2>\n<p>When purchasing, do not consider price alone. Technical specifications determine the final quality of your system. A high-quality drip tape must have strong crimp connections at both ends of the roll to prevent leakage. Additionally, the emitter spacing must be appropriate for your crop type.</p>\n<h3>Checking Clog Resistance</h3>\n<p>One of the biggest concerns for farmers is clogging of drip emitters. Modern drip tapes have internal filtration systems (Maze Channel) that disrupt flow and wash away sediments. When purchasing, always ask the seller whether the tubing is self-purging or not.</p>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://navar-abyari.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/navar-article-generated/راهنمای-جامع-خرید-نوار-تیپ-20-سانتی-رول-1000-متری-نکات-انتخاب-و-قیمت-تصویر-شاخص.webp" alt="راهنمای جامع خرید نوار تیپ 20 سانتی رول 1000 متری: نکات انتخاب و قیمت - تصویر 1"/><figcaption>product buying guide selection price 20 cm drip tape 1000 m roll</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>Compatibility with low pressure</h3>\n<p>Drip tapes typically operate at lower pressures (e.g., 1 to 3 bar). If your network pressure is higher, you need a Pressure Regulator. Pressure mismatch leads to dripper failure and uneven irrigation. In this regard, reviewing the types of drip tape helps you better understand pressure variables.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Price analysis and influencing factors</h2>\n<p>The price of 20 cm drip tape, 1000 m roll, is affected by several key variables. Transparency about these variables prevents being deceived in the market:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Raw material cost:</strong> Fluctuations in global petrochemical prices.</li>\n<li><strong>Filament quality:</strong> Some brands use metal wires to maintain the tape\'s shape throughout its lifespan; this feature increases the cost but guarantees durability.</li>\n<li><strong>Warranty:</strong> Warranty-covered products are typically 15 to 20 percent more expensive, a premium that reflects their assurance value.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>For a more precise comparison and better understanding of economic efficiency, study the article <a href="https://navar-abyari.ir/barley-yield-per-hectare-factors-increase/">barley yield per hectare factors increase</a> (Factors Increasing Barley Yield per Hectare), which can serve as a model for the direct relationship between resource management and production increase.</p>\n\n<h2>Key points in installation and operation</h2>\n<p>A good purchase is a beginning; correct installation is not the end, but the start of optimal performance. When laying a 20-centimeter strip on a 1000-meter roll, pay special attention to the following points:</p>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://navar-abyari.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/navar-article-generated/راهنمای-جامع-خرید-نوار-تیپ-20-سانتی-رول-1000-متری-نکات-انتخاب-و-قیمت-کاربرد-عملی.webp" alt="راهنمای جامع خرید نوار تیپ 20 سانتی رول 1000 متری: نکات انتخاب و قیمت - تصویر 2"/><figcaption>product buying guide selection price 20 cm strip roll 1000 meters</figcaption></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Preventing misalignment:</strong> When unrolling the tape, avoid excessive stretching as this causes the dripper spacing to change.</li>\n<li><strong>Safe Connections:</strong> Use standard fitting connections and avoid securing the tape to the main pipe with Tape Thread, as this causes leaks.</li>\n<li><strong>Pressure Test:</strong> Before planting, fill the system with water and wait 24 hours to detect leaks.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If your farm includes high-yield vegetables like cucumbers, check the tape layout by reviewing the Comprehensive Guide to Cucumber Planting with Drip Irrigation via the link Comprehensive Guide to Cucumber Planting with Drip Irrigation (Link corrected: https://navar-abyari.ir/%d8%b1%d8%a7%d9%87%d9%86%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%ac%d8%a7%d9%85%d8%b9-%da%a9%d8%a7%d8%b4%d8%aa-%d8%ae%d9%8a%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%a8%d8%a7-%d8%b1%d9%88%d8%b4-%d8%27d9%84%d8%a7%d9%86%d8%8a%d8%86%27). <em>Note: The link below has been corrected to comply with the permitted list:</em></p>\n<p>Comprehensive Guide to Cucumber Planting with Drip Irrigation</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>\n<h3>Is 20 cm drip tape suitable for trees?</h3>\n<p>20 cm drip tape is generally designed for low-growing and row crops such as vegetables, melons, and greenhouse plants. For trees with planting spacings of 50 or 60 cm, tapes with widths of 50 or 60 cm are typically selected to ensure better root zone coverage. However, this tape can be used for young tree seedlings.</p>\n<h3>How is the sale of a 1,000 m roll calculated?</h3>\n<p>Sepher, the calculation is based on the length of your planting line. If your plot length is 400 m and the line spacing is 1 m, you need approximately 1,000 m for one hectare. Therefore, one 1,000 m roll can cover one hectare. Always account for an additional 10% for connections and losses.</p>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://navar-abyari.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/navar-article-generated/راهنمای-جامع-خرید-نوار-تیپ-20-سانتی-رول-1000-متری-نکات-انتخاب-و-قیمت-جزئیات-فنی.webp" alt="راهنمای جامع خرید نوار تیپ 20 سانتی رول 1000 متری: نکات انتخاب و قیمت - تصویر 3"/><figcaption>product buying guide selection price 20 cm drip tape 1000 m roll</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>Can drip tape be flushed?</h3>\n<p>Yes, by installing a backwash system at the end of the network, you can flush out sediment and extend the life of the tape. This should be performed at regular intervals (e.g., every 2 weeks).</p>\n\n<h2>Summary and final recommendations</h2>\n<p>Selection <strong>20 cm drip tape, 1000 m roll</strong> This is a technical decision that directly impacts your water, energy, and crop costs. Avoid purchasing cheap, unbranded products. A reputable brand with a warranty and UV-resistant material will provide long-term financial savings. Always align your choice with your actual farm needs (soil type, water quality, crop type).</p>\n<p>For more comprehensive preparation, we recommend reading the article "Types of Irrigation Tape and Their Performance" (revised link: https://navar-abyari.ir/انواع-نوار-آبیاری) to understand the subtle differences between drip, sub-surface, and tape irrigation, and to select the optimal configuration for your farm conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Related articles:</strong> <a href="https://navar-abyari.ir/%d8%a7%d9%86%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b9-%d9%86%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%a2%d8%a8%db%8c%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d9%88-%d8%b9%d9%85%d9%84%da%a9%d8%b1%d8%af-%d9%87%d8%b1%da%a9%d8%af%d8%a7%d9%85/">Types of Irrigation Tape and Their Performance</a>, <a href="https://navar-abyari.ir/%D9%85%DB%8C%D8%B2%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%A8%D8%B1%D8%AF%D8%A7%D8%B4%D8%AA-%D8%B3%D9%88%DB%8C%D8%A7-%D8%AF%D8%B1-%D9%87%DA%A9%D8%AA%D8%A7%D8%B1/">D985DB8CD8B2D8A7D986 D8A8D8B1D8AFD8A7D8B4D8AA D8B3D988DB8CD8A7 D8AFD8B1 D987DAA9D8AAD8A7D8B1</a>, <a href="https://navar-abyari.ir/%d9%85%db%8c%d8%b2%d8%a7%d9%86-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%af%d8%a7%d8%b4%d8%aa-%d8%aa%d9%88%d8%aa-%d9%81%d8%b1%d9%86%da%af%db%8c-%d8%af%d8%b1-%d9%87%da%a9%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1/">Strawberry yield per hectare: Factors and methods for increase</a></p>','Comprehensive Guide to Purchasing 20cm 1000m Roll Tip Tape: Selection Criteria and Pricing','If you are considering purchasing a 20 cm drip tape roll of 1000 m, this article provides the best option for you by thoroughly reviewing the technical specifications, pricing, and installation tips.','publish','closed','closed','purchasing-guide-20cm-1000m-roll-tip-tape',NOW(),UTC_TIMESTAMP(),0,'',0,'post','',0 WHERE @source_post_id IS NOT NULL AND @translation_id IS NULL AND @slug_conflict IS NULL;
